# My Profile Website

A simple personal profile website created using HTML and CSS.

## About

This is my first profile website project. It contains my personal details, hobbies, profile image, and contact form.

## Features

- Navigation Bar
- Profile Section
- About Me Section
- Hobbies Section
- Contact Form
- Footer

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## Project Files

- profile.html - Main webpage
- styles.css - Styling file
- Profile Image - Website image

